    <string name="storage_server_text">The dropbox reports what it holds to the server on every transport visit. The server answers with a cleanup plan listing bundles that are safe to delete: deposits it has received (or that a newer one replaced) and pickups their client has acknowledged. Everything else is kept. The clear buttons above remain a manual override.</string>
